# HEE v4 ULTRAMAP: target architecture, derived from measured v3 findings

**Status: PLANNING ONLY.** Luke's HOLD (DR "HOLD: no coding until Luke says 'start coding'", 2026-10-01) is in force. Nothing here is built, and nothing here authorizes building.
**Measured basis:** v3 tree `b5367bc` (= origin/main), read via `git show`/`git grep` only; no cargo, no build, no run. Written 2026-10-01 by one same-lineage agent. **Not independently reviewed.**

