## 4 · Interface map (v4)

### 4a · Sockets and CLI (REUSE; IM §1, §3)
| Interface | v4 |
|---|---|
| `$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/hee4/control.sock` 0600 in 0700 dir + `control.lock` flock | custody code verbatim (`control_socket.rs:50-59,146,242,303`); the dir is renamed from v3's `habitat-engine/` so a v3 leftover `control.lock` cannot collide *(rev 2026-10-01, V4-11; supersedes "rename only if the unit name changes" and V4-5's `habitat-engine-v4/`)* |
| no TCP listener | kept (IM §4: `TcpListener` only in tests) |
| `hee4 serve \| commission <s> \| <action>` | v3 verbs verbatim under the new binary name, from `app::serve(Config)` *(rev 2026-10-01, V4-11)* |
